    "Text Editing" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "文字编辑"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Text fields keep standard macOS editing keys. Dialogs share the Apply/Cancel assignments above. Numeric fields use Up/Down, with Shift for larger steps. Standard macOS commands include ⌘Q to quit and ⌃⌘F for full screen. The shortcut editor itself always uses Return to save and Esc to cancel when not recording." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "文本栏沿用 macOS 的标准编辑按键。对话框共用上文的“应用/取消”按键分配。数值栏使用上/下方向键，按住 Shift 可加大步长。标准 macOS 命令包括 ⌘Q 退出和 ⌃⌘F 全屏。未在录制时，快捷键编辑器本身始终使用 Return 存储、Esc 取消。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Text Size" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "文字大小"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Text-editing shortcuts need Command, Option, or Control so they do not replace normal typing." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "文字编辑快捷键需要搭配 Command、Option 或 Control，以免替代正常的文字输入。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Texture" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "纹理"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That selection is too detailed to outline. Try a different Tolerance, or turn on Contiguous." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "该选区细节过多，无法勾勒轮廓。请尝试其他容差，或打开“连续”。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That shape is too large. A shape can cover up to %lld megapixels." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "该形状过大。一个形状最多可覆盖 %lld 百万像素。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That text box exceeds the %@-pixel or %lld-megapixel limit." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "That text box exceeds the %1$@-pixel or %2$lld-megapixel limit."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "该文本框超出 %@ 像素或 %lld 百万像素的限制。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The 2012 response. Calibration reaches most of the strength used by Version 6." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "2012 版响应。校准可达到版本 6 的大部分强度。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The brush trails the pointer on a string this long, so a shaky hand still draws a smooth line" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "画笔以这么长的绳索跟随指针，因此手抖也能画出平滑的线条。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The canvas could not be rendered. Try a smaller canvas." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "无法渲染画布。请尝试更小的画布。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The characters to draw with, in any order: each spot gets the one whose ink best matches its tone" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "用来绘制的字符，顺序不限：每个位置会使用墨水与其色调最匹配的字符。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The copied layers exceed this project’s %lld-megapixel limit." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "复制的图层超出此项目的 %lld 百万像素上限。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The font “%@” isn’t installed, so the text was drawn with the system font." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "字体“%@”未安装，文字已用系统字体绘制。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The height of each line of characters" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每行字符的高度"
          }
